                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Amazing artstyle, interesting story, overall a fun game but janky controls, copious amounts of bugs and the lack of a map make the exploration a pain, the exits/doors aren't highlighted and hard to see, and especially the gun/aiming is really frustrating because it requires you to be on the same axis as the enemy and if you're off by a milimeter it doesn't hit, while the gun shots for enemies and bosses seem to always hit you. Also the game soft-locked/froze twice in the dialogue after defeating the king, so I never got to see the ending. I gave up.",
